    83	
    84	def parse_eval_name(name):
    85	    """``Cell`` for a registered table cell; ``ValueError`` for anything else.
    86	
    87	    Deliberately strict about the three registered facts. The §5 invariance grid
    88	    writes ``..._s42_rot45`` cells of the SAME checkpoint and an optional
