   205	def is_exp11_row(patterns):
   206	    """Does this row's evidence come from the exp_11 orbit sweep?
   207	
   208	    exp_14's cells live under ``outputs_FLAC/exp11_<ARM>/`` — the ARM's run
   209	    directory, which exp_11 created — so the substring alone would claim them and
   210	    send them to a validator that only understands exp_11 eval names. Excluding
   211	    them here changes nothing for any exp_11 row (none names an exp14 artifact)
   212	    and keeps exp_11's gate exactly as it was.
