   855	        "**Orbit execution (exp_11 disclosure).** `fa eval (legacy-loop)` rows were produced by the "
   856	        "per-angle frame-average loop; `fa eval (batched)` rows by the batched-orbit implementation, "
   857	        "which shares one train-mode RoPE draw per chunk and regroups the split's tail batch. The two "
   858	        "are NOT interchangeable: inference is reserved for the contemporaneous C4L bridge and the "
   859	        "other exp_11 arms, and legacy-loop rows are background, never a substitute for C4L. exp_11 "
   860	        "rows are emitted only after `exp11_validate_rows.py` passes the table contract for that "
   861	        "cell (hashes recomputed); a cell that fails renders as **BLOCKED**.",
   862	        "",
   863	        "**exp_14 Z rows (one-pin re-measurement).** Rows labelled `exp_14 Z` are the "
   864	        "θ=0 reference block of the yaw-generalization campaign: all five arms measured "
   865	        "at ONE evaluator pin, so VANL-vs-Cn among them is frame averaging alone. They "
   866	        "are gated by `exp14_validate_cell.py` (the same predicate the screen driver and "
   867	        "the wave submitter run) and publish only as a complete two-K, five-seed, "
   868	        "single-pin transaction, and each arm's pair publishes independently while all "
